{"slug":"UPDATE-The-Storage-TS-Hub-OP-2026-244687","_id":"6a601475a3bee6f2fcaa8f4e","title":"TS Hub | 20+ Features","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e79","gameId":13704594433,"name":"[UPDATE] The Storage","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-d89868ac1a0955724de18e4c49c2b7fb-d29a474c6cfa.png","placeId":13704594433},"features":"📦 TS Script 📦\n\nVersion 1.0.4 (24/07/2026)\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Visuals (Player ESP, Enemies ESP, Loot ESP and FullBright)\n\n- Moviment (Auto-Run, Speed, Panic, NoClip and Fly)\n\n- Items (Auto Buy, Auto Farm Rooms, General Auto Farm , Weapons and Items)\n\n- Teleport (Base, Surface, Elevator, Basement and NPCs)\n\n- Misc (Aimbot, Auto Reload, Auto Knife, Remove Interaction Delay and Anti-AFK)\n\n- Notifications (NPC Alerts, Mobs Alerts and Bounty Alerts)\n\nPress RSHIFT to Open the HUB!\n\nThe Player ESP includes a feature called EIW (Estimated Inventory Worth), which estimates the total selling value of all the items a player is carrying. \n\nThe Auto Farm Rooms feature is recommended for private servers or servers with few players. It includes Surface Auto Farm and Basement Auto Farm. The General Auto Farm, that collects everything on the map, can cause some lag. Because of this, I recommend staying in a safe location, such as your base, and letting the autofarm run while you do something else.","tags":["thestorage","the storage","ts","freenokey"],"script":"--[[\n  _______ _              _____ _                             \n |__   __| |            / ____| |                            \n    | |  | |__   ___   | (___ | |_ ___  _ __ __ _  __ _  ___ \n    | |  | '_ \\ / _ \\   \\___ \\| __/ _ \\| '__/ _` |/ _` |/ _ \\\n    | |  | | | |  __/   ____) | || (_) | | | (_| | (_| |  __/\n    |_|  |_| |_|\\___|  |_____/ \\__\\___/|_|  \\__,_|\\__, |\\___|\n                                                   __/ |     \n                                                  |___/                                                                               \n        